#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use the Qiskit Estimator and Sampler backend primitives."
msgstr ""
"כיצד להשתמש ב-primitives של Estimator ו-Sampler עבור Backend ב-Qiskit."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with the backend primitives"
msgstr "התחלה עם primitives של Backend"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get started with the backend primitives {#get-started-with-the-backend-"
"primitives}"
msgstr ""
"התחלה עם primitives של Backend {#get-started-with-the-backend-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unlike provider-specific primitives, backend primitives are generic implementations that can be used with an arbitrary\n"
"`backend` object, as long as it implements the [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) interface.  Some providers implement primitives natively.  See the [Qiskit Ecosystem page](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem?tag=provider) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"בניגוד ל-primitives ספציפיים לספק, primitives של Backend הם מימושים גנריים "
"שניתן להשתמש בהם עם כל אובייקט `backend`, כל עוד הוא מממש את הממשק "
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)."
" חלק מהספקים מממשים primitives באופן מקורי. ראה את [דף המערכת האקולוגית של "
"Qiskit](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem?tag=provider) לפרטים.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"estimator\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"estimator\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get started with the Estimator backend primitive {#get-started-with-the-"
"estimator-backend-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"התחלה עם primitive Estimator של Backend {#get-started-with-the-estimator-"
"backend-primitive}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Estimator primitive can be run with any provider by using the "
"[`qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2)"
" class. However, it offers no measurement or gate error mitigation "
"implementations \"out-of-the-box\", as backend primitives are designed to "
"run locally in the user's machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"ניתן להריץ את ה-primitive Estimator עם כל ספק באמצעות הכיתה "
"[`qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2)."
" עם זאת, הוא לא מציע מימושי הפחתת שגיאות מדידה או Gate \"מהקופסה\", מכיוון "
"שה-primitives של Backend מתוכננים לפעול מקומית על מחשב המשתמש.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example: {#example}"
msgstr "דוגמה: {#example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"sampler\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"sampler\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get started with the Sampler backend primitive {#get-started-with-the-"
"sampler-backend-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"התחלה עם primitive Sampler של Backend {#get-started-with-the-sampler-"
"backend-primitive}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Sampler primitive can be run with any provider by using "
"[`qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2)."
" However, it requires a backend that supports the `memory` option.\n"
msgstr ""
"ניתן להריץ את ה-primitive Sampler עם כל ספק באמצעות "
"[`qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendSamplerV2)."
" עם זאת, הוא דורש Backend שתומך באפשרות `memory`.\n"

